{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design", "label": "Strategy-first decision core + the Researcher", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-strategy-first-core-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The cutover off the blended vote is manual: an automatic rule would need a threshold nobody can justify yet, and the strategy-only vs actual comparison is the thing worth looking at. Strategy-only decisions are therefore journalled in shadow from the start."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design_strategy_first", "label": "Strategy-first decision core", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-strategy-first-core-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Measured over 115,446 decisions only 10.3% carried any strategy signal and 53% of directional decisions had none, so the blend is kept running as a temporary migration until validated mechanisms exist."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design_mechanism", "label": "Validated Mechanism (Researcher handoff)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-strategy-first-core-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three fields the Strategist currently guesses become measurements: scope\u2192spec.regime_filter, horizon\u2192spec.exit.time.max_bars, observable\u2192the core term of entry_long/entry_short."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design_thesis", "label": "Researcher Thesis (pre-registered)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-strategy-first-core-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pre-registration is what separates this from data mining: prediction and kill condition are written before data is touched and immutable after; the challenge step is a mechanical confound battery because LLMs produce the shape of skepticism, not skepticism."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.8, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-strategy-first-core-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 0.8}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_strategy_generation_rebuild_design_strategyspec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-strategy-first-core-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design_strategy_first", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-strategy-first-core-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_01_researcher_and_strategy_first_core_design_thesis", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-01-researcher-and-